==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[tottered]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}} {{term|tatered|lang=enm}}, {{term|tatird|lang=en}}, from {{suffix|tatter|ed}}. Originally it was derived from the noun, but later it was treated as a past participle implying a verb. Cf {{term|tatter|lang=en}}.

